<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-ROSENBORG V PORTO TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROSENBORG V PORTO TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup Champions League Group D match between Rosenborg and Porto of Portugal:</p>
<p>Rosenborg - 1-Jorn Jamtfall; 3-Erik Hoftun, 5-Stale Stensaas, 6-Roar Strand, 8-Bent Skammelsrud, 10-Harald Brattbakk, 11-Jahn Ivar Jakobsen, 14-Vegard Heggem, 16-Steffen Iversen, 18-Bjorn Kvarme, 20-Trond Soltvedt</p>
<p>Porto - 24-Hilario; 5-Fernando Mendes, 4-Aloisio, 7-Sergeio Conceicao, 11-Ljubinko Drulovic, 14-Artur, 17-Barroso, 20-Paulinho Santos, 21-Edmilson, 22-Jorge Costa, 25-Zlatko Zahovic</p>
